OL,3,GNEWSAFamily criticises delay in police
OL,4,Ashooting inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died after a
OL,7,Fstand-off with armed officers at his
OL,8,Fhome on Christmas Eve in 2024 have
OL,9,Fcriticised the length of time an
OL,10,Finvestigation into his death is taking.
OL,12,FMarcus Meade was shot after a five-hour
OL,13,Fincident on Fownhope Close in Redditch,
OL,14,FWorcestershire.
OL,16,FSupporters said they were led to
OL,17,Fbelieve the inquiry would be completed
OL,18,Fin eight months, but the BBC has been
OL,19,Ftold one of the West Mercia Police
OL,20,Fofficers identified during the
OL,21,Finvestigation is yet to be interviewed.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
