OL,3,GNEWSAFamily criticises delay in police
OL,4,Ashooting inquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Independent Office of Police
OL,7,FConduct (IOPC) said it had received
OL,8,Fwritten statements from two officers,
OL,9,Fand it was trying to arrange a date to
OL,10,Fspeak to the third to get "additional
OL,11,Fdetailed information".
